  "description": "The fastest cache library written in C# for items with set expiration time. Easy to use, thread-safe and light on memory.\nOptimized to scale from dozens to millions of items. Features lock-free reads and writes, allocation-free reads and automatic eviction.\nCredit to Vladimir Sadov for his implementation of NonBlocking.ConcurrentDictionary which is used as an underlying store.",
